Required Components:

✅ Service Layers:
	•	RefundSchedulerService
	•	RefundProcessorService
	•	RefundFileGeneratorService
	•	RefundAPIClientService
	•	KafkaRefundPublisherService

✅ DAO & Repository:
	•	RefundBookingRepository – to fetch/update refund records
	•	RefundConfigRepository – to fetch refund mode config
	•	TransactionStatusUpdater (consumer microservice)

✅ Kafka Topic:
	•	refund-processing-status

⸻

Exception Scenarios to Handle:

Scenario	Action Taken
Refund API fails	Decrement retry, log error
File Upload fails on SFTP	Decrement retry, log error
Invalid refund amount (Chargeback)	Mark as REFUND_FAILED, add remark
Retry Exhausted	Mark as REFUND_FAILED, log


